The NWDAF services under nwdaf/ are modified from oai-cn5g-nwdaf (branch develop,
commit 9d82b7547586a6e04dc0719ef18910ea01fcd9e7).

Changes to the OAI network functions are distributed as patches under patches/,
each pinned to the upstream commit it applies to. The upstream repositories are
not vendored here. AMF, UPF-VPP, UDR, UDM and AUSF are used unmodified.

UE credentials in compose/ (KEY, OPc, IMSI) are OpenAirInterface's public
tutorial test vectors, not secrets.
